<p><b class="list-bullet">Raspberry Pi Foundation</b></p>
<h4>Recent Developments</h4>
<p>In March 2023, Intel Corporation launched its latest line of NUC mini PCs, featuring advanced processors and enhanced graphics capabilities, targeting both gaming and professional markets. This launch is expected to strengthen Intel's position in the mini PC segment and cater to the growing demand for high-performance compact solutions.</p>
<p>In June 2024, ASUS announced a partnership with a leading gaming software company to optimize its mini PCs for esports, enhancing performance and user experience. This collaboration aims to tap into the rapidly growing gaming market and attract a broader customer base.</p>
<p>In January 2025, HP Inc. unveiled a new series of mini PCs designed specifically for educational institutions, focusing on affordability and ease of use. This initiative aims to support the growing demand for technology in classrooms and enhance learning experiences for students.</p>
