<section id="emer-faq" class="content-block faq-block">
    <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

    <div class="faq-list">
                    <details class="faq-item" open>
                <summary class="faq-question">
                    <span>What is the expected growth rate of the US Mini PC Market?</span>
                    <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">×</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    The US Mini PC Market is projected to grow at a CAGR of 8.9% from 2024 to 2034.
                </div>
            </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" >
                <summary class="faq-question">
                    <span>What are the primary drivers of market growth?</span>
                    <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    Key drivers include rising demand for compact computing solutions, technological advancements in miniaturization, and increasing adoption in remote work and education sectors.
                </div>
            </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" >
                <summary class="faq-question">
                    <span>Which segment holds the largest market share?</span>
                    <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    The Desktop Mini PCs segment held the largest market share in 2024, accounting for approximately 70% of the market.
                </div>
            </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" >
                <summary class="faq-question">
                    <span>What is the fastest-growing segment in the market?</span>
                    <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    The Stick PCs segment is projected to grow at the fastest CAGR of 12% during the forecast period.
                </div>
            </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" >
                <summary class="faq-question">
                    <span>What applications are driving demand for mini PCs?</span>
                    <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    Key applications driving demand include Gaming, Home Office, and Education.
                </div>
            </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" >
                <summary class="faq-question">
                    <span>Who are the key players in the US Mini PC Market?</span>
                    <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
                </summary>
                <div class="faq-answer">
                    Major players include Intel Corporation, ASUS, HP Inc., Dell Technologies, and Lenovo Group Limited.
                </div>
            </details>
                    <details class="faq-item" >
                <summary class="faq-question">
                    <span>What challenges does the market face?</span>
                    <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
